"g-henchard","label":"Henchard (shared surname)"},{"id":"g-cuxsom","label":"Cuxsom (shared surname)"}],"characters":[{"id":"lucetta","name":"Lucetta","role":"protagonist","firstAppearance":"s18","summary":"First mention: “As requested, he sealed up Lucetta’s letters, and put the parcel aside till the day she had appointed; this plan of returning them by hand being apparently a little _ruse_ of the young lady for exchanging a word or tw…”"},{"id":"elizabeth-jane","name":"Elizabeth-Jane","role":"protagonist","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: ““I always like furmity; and so does Elizabeth-Jane; and so will you.”"},{"id":"elizabeth","name":"Elizabeth","role":"protagonist","firstAppearance":"s3","summary":"First mention: “She briefly thanked her informant, and rejoined Elizabeth, who greeted her with, “Mother, do let’s get on—it was hardly respectable for you to buy refreshments there.”"},{"id":"donald-farfrae","name":"Donald Farfrae","aliases":["Donald"],"role":"major","group":"g-farfrae","firstAppearance":"s7","summary":"First mention: ““My name is Donald Farfrae.”"},{"id":"richard-newson","name":"Richard Newson","aliases":["Newson"],"role":"major","group":"g-newson","firstAppearance":"s3","summary":"First mention: ““It was here I first met with Newson—on such a day as this.””"},{"id":"jopp","name":"Jopp","role":"major","firstAppearance":"s7","summary":"First mention: “Joshua, Joshua, Jipp—Jopp—what was his name?””"},{"id":"mayor","name":"Mayor","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s5","summary":"First mention: ““Why, ’tis a great public dinner of the gentle-people and such like leading volk—wi’ the Mayor in the chair.”"},{"id":"mr-henchard","name":"Mr. Henchard","role":"supporting","group":"g-henchard","firstAppearance":"s5","summary":"First mention: ““We might, perhaps, after all, make a few inquiries about—our relation Mr.”"},{"id":"scotchman","name":"Scotchman","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s6","summary":"First mention: “He was a Scotchman